  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Achieving the Migration Dimensions of the SDGs in Spain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the aim of supporting the Spanish Ministry of Social Rights and the 2030 Agenda in its contribution towards achieving the SDGs in the field of migration, IOM contemplates the elaboration of a study on the identification of the main challenges and vulnerabilities of the migration population in Spain and in particular, those linked to the SDGs. The study will be conducted through the individualized anonymous surveys with migrants residing in Spain in both regular and irregular situation.</narrative>
  </description>
